{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827237459263519","content":"A small songbird flies into the village, through a window, and deposits a letter on the chief's desk. It flies away.","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:24:48.999000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743007066255261736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827237459263519","content":"The letter reads: ||I send this hoping to forge a potential new friendship, or at least avert conflict. My name is Web. I arrived with the others who crashed, though I cannot speak for all of them. I belong to the same order as our mutual friend Archivist Daysong. I wish, in his absence, to establish a new line of communication. If you have a way of returning a letter I would greatly appreciate a response. Failing that I will send this bird again tomorrow, which you may give a letter or speak your response. Can be found in the tall tree with spiders, on outskirts of new settlement. Would love to talk face to face, but can make do with this method.||","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:19:10.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743020747902943345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827237459263519","content":"The bird returns with another letter:\n||Agree that situations are dire. Could Longshadow be convinced to draw forces back if flooding stops? Believe that if Chinookin could access their breeding grounds, flooding would stop and they would return. Know this is not ideal for your people, though may be only way to resolve peacefully. What is Longshadow like as a leader. Have personally met the fishmother, but not Longshadow.||","created_at":"2020-08-12T19:41:15.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743192399584428102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827237459263519","content":"Another letter arrives:\n||If flooding stopped, would Longshadow draw back forces? Would stop war before starts? Have personally assisted in removal of two lodestones previous. Believe colonists can end flooding. Hopefully restore tenuous peace. ||","created_at":"2020-08-12T19:57:00.553000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743196361712992377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827237459263519","content":"A bird arrives, looking for Ohma. If it finds him it will give a note. Otherwise it will return to Web. \n||Have heard of Longshadow's death and Empty Hill's leadership. This better or worse? Hope your people survived the battle well enough. Island should be returning to normal height. Lodestones at temple used to fix. Thank you for your help. -Web, truth seeker.||","created_at":"2020-08-13T19:20:08.251000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743549470511202325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
